    <item>
      <title>Shortwave soul, now streaming live!</title>
      <link>https://America.ning.com/articles/shortwave-soul-now-streaming-live</link>
      <description>Shortwave soul, now streaming live! 📻✨ Miss the hiss and personality of the shortwave bands? Charleston Radio International hasn't lost its edge; it just changed how you find it. 🌍 The station moved from Shortwave transmitters to the web, but with a deliberate aesthetic twist: the stream runs at 24 kbps. Forget that sterile, over-polished digital audio; this choice is all about recreating that raw, authentic AM radio sound and the unmistakable analog vibe that defined an era. Hitting "Play" feel</description>
